  "raw_text_excerpt": "2026 ITALIAN GRAND PRIX\n04 - 06 September 2026\nThe FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate\nFrom The FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate\nTo The Stewards\nDocument 13\nDate 04 September 2026\nTime 12:32\nTitle Technical Delegate's Report\nDescription New PU Elements for this Competition\nEnclosed 13 ITA GP 26 TDR3.pdf\nJo Bauer\n\n2026 ITALIAN GRAND PRIX \n04 - 06 September 2026 \n  \n \nFrom :  The FIA Formula 1 Technical Delegate  \nTo :  The Stewards Date :  04 September 2026 \n  \n \nTechnical Delegate’s Report \n \n \nThe following drivers will start the thirteenth Competition of the 2026 Formula One World \nChampionship with a new internal combustion engine (ICE): \n \nNumber Car Driver Previously used ICE \n    \n81 McLaren Mercedes Oscar Piastri 3 \n01 McLaren Mercedes Lando Norris 3 \n12 Mercedes Kimi Antonelli 4 \n16 Ferrari Charles Leclerc 3 \n44 Ferrari Lewis Hamilton 3 \n23 \nAtlassian Williams Mercedes Alexander Albon 4 \n55 Atlassian Williams Mercedes Carlos Sainz 3 \n87 Haas Ferrari Oliver Bearman 3 \n05 \nAudi Gabriel Bortoleto 2 \n10 Alpine Mercedes Pierre Gasl y 3 \n43 Alpine Mercedes Franco Colapinto 3 \n \nThe internal combustion engine used by Kimi Antonelli and Alexander Albon is the fifth (5\nth) of \nthe four"
